WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.560
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain the American science fiction film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.440
called “Voyagers.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:22.000
The movie starts in the year 2063 AD. Human&nbsp;
existence is at risk of extinction because of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.360
climate change, decreasing biodiversity, and&nbsp;
decreasing supply of clean drinking water.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:33.120
The deteriorating situation of the earth has been&nbsp;
troubling scientists for a long time. In such&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:38.000
harsh conditions, they work hard to find a planet&nbsp;
where humans can settle upon. At the beginning of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.480
the movie, the top scientists and astronomers&nbsp;
of the world are in a conference meeting.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:47.440
They have finally found an Earth-like exoplanet&nbsp;
far away in the galaxy and discuss how they can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:52.560
colonize it. An astrophysicist who is presenting&nbsp;
the idea says that they will have to leave for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:57.920
exoplanet as soon as possible because the voyage&nbsp;
will take eighty-six years. Thus, the crew will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:02.960
have to reproduce on board and only the third&nbsp;
generation of humans who board the ship will make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:08.400
it to the exoplanet. The scientists’ first problem&nbsp;
is to find thirty qualified crew members who are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:13.760
willing to leave everyone they know on earth to&nbsp;
spend the rest of their lives on a spaceship. 
&nbsp;

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:18.640
Moreover, they have to ensure that no one feels&nbsp;
the stress of prolonged confinement because then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:23.360
they would want to return to the earth. The only&nbsp;
solution to this problem is to breed their own&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:28.320
crew members and train them in isolation. That&nbsp;
way, the crew members wouldn’t know how the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:34.160
earth was and wouldn’t feel nostalgic. So, the&nbsp;
scientists use bioengineering to give birth to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:40.000
thirty babies who will in the future initiate the&nbsp;
eighty-six years-long voyage to the exoplanet. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:45.360
kids are raised and trained by a scientist named&nbsp;
Richard Alling. Richard treats the kids as his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:50.640
own and with time, grows attached to them. After&nbsp;
a few years, he insists on joining them on their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:59.040
trip to space. His colleague warns that he will&nbsp;
never be able to return but Richard is adamant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:03.600
about the decision. Eventually, when the kids&nbsp;
are of a certain age, they fly to outer space&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:07.840
with Richard as their guardian. The ship will&nbsp;
be their home for the rest of their lives. 
&nbsp;

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:12.800
Cut to some years later. The kids have grown&nbsp;
into youngsters and are perfectly accustomed to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:18.000
their lives in space. They wake up every day at&nbsp;
the same time and take educational classes that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:23.520
tell them of their purpose. Then, they exercise&nbsp;
and do a regular mechanical check. After that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:29.280
they eat together in the cafeteria. Throughout&nbsp;
all this, the crew seems void of human emotions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:33.040
as they do not chat with each other&nbsp;
often. An important part of their day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:38.320
is taking a blue liquid after every meal. 
In the following scene, we see two crew members&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:43.600
named Chris and Zach listening to classical&nbsp;
music as a recreational activity. Another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:48.880
member named Cela is having doubts about the&nbsp;
mission and thinks of her life as unimportant.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:53.200
So, she talks to Richard about it. Richard&nbsp;
calmly explains that they are the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:58.480
important humans in history. He reveals he has&nbsp;
been feeling lonely for a long time and shows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:03.600
Cela pictures of his family from the earth.
The crew grows its own plant to sustain life for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:10.080
the years they will be on the ship. One day, Chris&nbsp;
discovers that there is a toxin named T56J in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:14.640
water they irrigate the plants with. The water&nbsp;
is filtered urine which means that the toxin is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:19.680
coming from the crew’s body. He asks Richard about&nbsp;
the toxin but he simply tells Chris to change the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:25.360
filtration system. Later, Chris does some research&nbsp;
on the toxin but finds no information about it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:30.720
in the database. He even tells Zac about the&nbsp;
matter. After everyone is asleep at night, the two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:35.840
hack into the database and find out that the toxin&nbsp;
comes from the blue liquid they drink every day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:41.360
They also reveal that the toxin makes humans&nbsp;
docile, eliminates sexual desires, and decreases&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:46.320
pleasure response. That means the crew is&nbsp;
being drugged so they can be kept in check. 
&nbsp;

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:51.040
From the following day, Zac and Chris stop&nbsp;
taking the blue liquid. They also tell two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:55.600
of the other crew members named Kai and&nbsp;
Julie about the discovery. Moreover,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.600 --> 00:04:00.640
Chris has also found an unmarked compartment&nbsp;
in the ship behind the walls. The four of them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:05.280
have begun to doubt their creators. During&nbsp;
a routine conversation with Richard, Chris&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:10.000
tells him that he has discovered an unidentified&nbsp;
chamber in the blueprints, and demands to know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:15.040
its purpose and what exactly is inside of it.&nbsp;
Richard proceeds to evasively tell him that such&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:20.240
information is classified and that the chamber is&nbsp;
reserved for the third generation on board. 
&nbsp;

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:25.120
The following day, Chris and Zac go through the&nbsp;
emotions they have never felt in their lives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:33.040
before. Being off the blue liquid is like being on&nbsp;
drugs for them. Zach feels sexually attracted to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:38.080
Sela and grabs her arm. He lets go of her only&nbsp;
after Richard casually tells him to maintain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:43.040
distance. During their workout, Zac and Chris&nbsp;
play fight, feeling the rush of adrenaline for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:48.080
the first time. Sometime later, the two are in&nbsp;
the hallways when they hear strange noises from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:53.040
the ship’s ceiling. They go to the control room&nbsp;
and ask crewmate Edward about it. Richard has told&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:57.280
them that it is just the noise of the ship’s parts&nbsp;
contracting. But Edward believes that the noise&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:02.720
is caused by some extraterrestrial creature. 
After a while, Richard holds an emergency meeting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:07.680
informing the crew that they have lost contact&nbsp;
with the earth because of some LCT malfunction.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:12.160
They will have to repair the transmitter from&nbsp;
the outside of the ship. Richard asks Zac to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:17.520
join him and assigns everyone their respective&nbsp;
roles. As they prepare, Zac starts touching Sela&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:25.680
inappropriately. A surprised Richard stops him and&nbsp;
asks Sela if she is fine. Zac runs away from them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:30.640
and Richard goes behind him. A girl named&nbsp;
Phoebe informs Richard that Zac has stopped&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:35.840
taking the blue liquid. Richard then meets Chris&nbsp;
who reveals that he hasn’t been taking it either.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:40.560
The two decide to complete the reparation first&nbsp;
then talk about the matter. They get into their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:45.520
spacesuits and go outside. Meanwhile, Kai from&nbsp;
the navigation room helps them as the others&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:50.560
are in the control room doing the same. Kai is&nbsp;
soon joined by Zac. All of a sudden, Richard’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:56.240
suit malfunctions and electrocutes him. At the&nbsp;
same time, the whole ship malfunctions making&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.240 --> 00:06:01.760
the crew panic. The systems room catches on fire&nbsp;
while every technical difficulty arises at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:07.200
same time. The crew set the fire out while Chris&nbsp;
somehow manages to get Richard inside the ship.
&nbsp;

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:11.920
They hurriedly take him to the medbay and use&nbsp;
a defibrillator on him. However, it doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:18.320
work and Richard dies. Sela, being the chief&nbsp;
medical professional, sadly announces him dead.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:23.360
After everything calms down, the crew surrounds&nbsp;
Richard’s body and discusses what went wrong.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:27.680
Edward says that he saw something dark pull&nbsp;
Richard right before his death. He thinks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:32.880
it was an alien. Chris assures everyone that it&nbsp;
was outside the ship so they should be fine. Zac&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:37.440
volunteers to be the new chief officer replacing&nbsp;
Richard but everyone else decides they should&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:43.120
vote. The voting takes place and eventually Chris&nbsp;
is elected as the chief officer. He then orders&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:47.840
everyone to repair the damage that was caused to&nbsp;
the ship as soon as possible. The crew gets to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:53.200
work and Sela goes to Richard’s room to get rid&nbsp;
of his belongings as per the protocol. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:57.920
she begins to watch pictures and videos&nbsp;
of his family and decides to keep them.
&nbsp;

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:02.240
Christopher joins her and the two watch the&nbsp;
video documentary that Richard had made.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:06.800
In the video, he says that he came to the mission&nbsp;
because he wanted to protect the kids. The two are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:12.240
confused as to what they need protection from but&nbsp;
little do they know what is about to happen next.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:18.000
A while later, Chris goes to check on the crew’s&nbsp;
progress and sees no one around. He finds everyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:22.640
in the plantation area trying to fix the food&nbsp;
storage. Zac had brought them there saying that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:27.200
food should be their first priority and they&nbsp;
shouldn’t let it go bad. Chris agrees and lets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:32.240
them do what they want. After dinner that day, Kai&nbsp;
tells everyone not to drink the blue liquid. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:37.280
following day, the crew feels various emotions&nbsp;
at the same time that they cannot control.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:42.320
Their anger and desires are heightened. 
Zac and Julie touch each other, feeling attracted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:47.520
to the opposite sex for the first time. Others&nbsp;
fight, run around the ship and ignore all their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:52.640
duties. One day, they get into Richard’s room&nbsp;
and watch films in his collection. From those,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:58.240
they find out about violence, guns, and sexual&nbsp;
intercourse. Sela finds them in the room and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:03.600
orders them to get out as the chief medical&nbsp;
officer. On his way out, Zac threatens Sela,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:08.160
asking her to be careful because Richard isn't&nbsp;
there to protect her anymore. Later that day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:13.600
Chris sees Kai and Julie having intercourse in&nbsp;
the exercise room. He also notices Zac looking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:19.440
for Sela and runs to her before he can. He&nbsp;
hugs her to show Zac she is already busy. 
&nbsp;

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:25.360
At the same time, Kai finds a guy named Peter&nbsp;
and Julie getting close. Enraged with jealousy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:30.640
he attacks Peter, making him run away. Later,&nbsp;
everyone is at the cafeteria when Peter hits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:35.520
Kai with a metal tool to take revenge. Chris&nbsp;
and the others separate the fight and schedule&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:40.720
an emergency meeting in the control room. In the&nbsp;
meeting, Chris puts forward his dissatisfaction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:45.440
regarding the crew’s performance but Zac&nbsp;
interrupts him frequently. Edward says that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:50.000
doesn’t want to work in the control room anymore&nbsp;
because he thinks it has aliens brought by Richard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:55.440
when he last space walked. This scares everyone&nbsp;
as they too have been hearing the noises. Taking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.440 --> 00:09:00.000
this opportunity, Zac says that he will save the&nbsp;
crew from the aliens and provide them with a lot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:05.040
of food. He also declares that he is forming a&nbsp;
separate group from Chris and people on his side&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:09.760
can follow him. Half of the crew leaves with&nbsp;
Zac while the other half stays with Chris. 
&nbsp;

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:14.320
Chris’s group is also worried that the alien might&nbsp;
be real so they go to collect the surveillance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:20.400
footage from the systems room. After they leave,&nbsp;
Zac’s team arrives there and Kai and he go inside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:25.440
They act like an alien attacked them in the room&nbsp;
to scare their group and keep them submissive.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:29.680
Meanwhile, Chris and the group watch the&nbsp;
surveillance footage and find a clip of Zac&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:34.880
and Kai deliberately electrocuting Richard. They&nbsp;
are beyond surprised when they find that the two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:40.240
killed Richard. The following morning, they are&nbsp;
woken up by a knock on the door. Zac and his group&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:45.120
are there to invite them for lunch. Chris and the&nbsp;
team carefully come to the cafeteria and start to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:51.040
eat. Just then, Zac walks in front of everyone&nbsp;
and declares himself the new chief officer. 
&nbsp;

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:55.920
But Chris retaliates and shows everyone the clip&nbsp;
of Zac and Kai killing Richard. Everyone gets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.920 --> 00:10:01.200
up in surprise but to their confusion, Zac admits&nbsp;
to killing him. He says that he had seen an alien&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:06.160
attach to Richard and had to kill him to kill&nbsp;
the alien. He then says that the alien might have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:11.360
attached itself to someone else from the crew. The&nbsp;
naive crew believes him and starts suspecting each&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:16.880
other. With no evidence, they blame Peter&nbsp;
for carrying the alien and beat him to death.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:22.320
After that, they collect all the sharp weapons&nbsp;
to fight the alien if it is still in the ship.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:27.600
Zac’s team is skeptical but they are afraid to&nbsp;
speak against him. Meanwhile, in Chris’s team,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:32.080
Sela suggests they get the weapons from the&nbsp;
secret compartment that Chris knows about. In the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:36.560
following scene, we see Chris trying to open the&nbsp;
secret compartment behind the wall. But he gets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:41.520
the passcode wrong making an alarm go off. 
He runs away from the compartment and Zac’s team&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:46.160
arrives there. They get their hands on the weapons&nbsp;
and claim them as their own. Two of Chris’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:51.760
teammates decide to join Zac. Zac asks them for&nbsp;
the other’s location in turn for taking them in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:56.800
and they happily tell him where the others are.&nbsp;
Now, his team approach Chris, Sela, and Phoebe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:02.560
in the surveillance room. They barge inside and&nbsp;
hold Chris hostage. Before they can take him away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:07.840
Phoebe loses her control and yells at everyone to&nbsp;
come back to their senses. To everyone’s surprise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:11.360
an annoyed Zac shoots her dead. 
Knowing that they are next,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:16.560
Chris and Sela run away from the others. They&nbsp;
are soon followed by the group. After a while,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:20.880
Zac finds them and chases them into the&nbsp;
airlock with a gun in his hand. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:26.800
with no way out, Chris quickly thinks of a plan.&nbsp;
He and Sela put on space suits and open the hatch.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:30.463
So when Zac barges in, he is pulled into space.&nbsp;
He holds on tight to the doorframe and refuses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.463 --> 00:11:32.880
to move but at last, he is pushed into space.&nbsp;
Sela and Chris return to the rest of the group&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:37.680
who have become docile without their leader. The&nbsp;
scene changes to some days later when everything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:42.960
has gone back to normal. After an election, Sela&nbsp;
is chosen as the new chief. She keeps a video&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:48.000
documentary as Richard did. In the documentary,&nbsp;
she reveals that they have decided not to take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:53.200
the blue liquid again. But they will vote on&nbsp;
everything so no further conflicts arise. 
&nbsp;

00:11:56.880 --> 00:12:02.080
A few weeks after the restoration of democracy&nbsp;
and peace, Sela finds out that she is pregnant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:07.120
with Chris' child, and eventually gives birth to&nbsp;
a boy. Things seem to have changed back to normal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:12.080
and everyone on the ship is happy. For the next&nbsp;
few decades, kids run around the ship playing and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:16.720
learning about their duties while the elders take&nbsp;
care of them and teach them their true purpose.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:21.280
And finally, after eighty-six years since&nbsp;
the launch, the ship is about to land on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:26.240
the destination planet. The movie ends as&nbsp;
the old and the new generation watch them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:30.480
getting closer to their new home. 
